{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00323",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 3.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Morning. Just put your bag down anywhere."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.27,
      "end_seconds": 6.11,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Hi. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.01,
      "end_seconds": 8.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Right, was parking alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.34,
      "end_seconds": 13.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Not great, I ended up a few streets away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 13.99,
      "end_seconds": 16.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "How can I help you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.83,
      "end_seconds": 24.95,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "Um, you know, so... pain in my left wrist after a fall. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.39,
      "end_seconds": 30.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "And when did that start? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.36,
      "end_seconds": 44.66,
      "duration_seconds": 13.3,
      "text": "Uh, you know, probably ten days. Yeah. It's a relief to finally sit down and talk about it. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.98,
      "end_seconds": 47.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.58,
      "text": "Does anything make it better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.92,
      "end_seconds": 51.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Well, only holding it still, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.06,
      "end_seconds": 55.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.71,
      "end_seconds": 58.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Mild, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.02,
      "end_seconds": 61.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.38,
      "text": "Okay, is there anything that triggers it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.55,
      "end_seconds": 64.35,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "It's worse with gripping."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.06,
      "end_seconds": 67.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Have you had tingling in the fingers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.16,
      "end_seconds": 74.84,
      "duration_seconds": 6.68,
      "text": "Yes, since Friday. I mean, I've also had a weak grip, for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.3,
      "end_seconds": 91.72,
      "duration_seconds": 15.42,
      "text": "Just so you know how the rest of the visit will go: I'll finish my notes, we'll agree on the plan, and the front desk will help with anything that needs booking. You shouldn't need to chase anything yourself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.23,
      "end_seconds": 96.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "Good, I was wondering how this would go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.83,
      "end_seconds": 100.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.8,
      "text": "And loss of consciousness, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.29,
      "end_seconds": 104.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Not at all, no loss of consciousness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.61,
      "end_seconds": 108.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any pain in the shoulder or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.7,
      "end_seconds": 112.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "No, no pain in the shoulder or numbness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.45,
      "end_seconds": 115.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "I see. Okay, and your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.79,
      "end_seconds": 118.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.41,
      "end_seconds": 123.85,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.05,
      "end_seconds": 132.49,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 133.63,
      "end_seconds": 139.98,
      "duration_seconds": 6.35,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Pressure 123 over 72, pulse 71, temperature 36.6."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.68,
      "end_seconds": 147.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Okay, noted. Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.14,
      "end_seconds": 152.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Apixaban, 5 milligrams, maybe, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.54,
      "end_seconds": 156.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.42,
      "end_seconds": 163.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. I'm on paracetamol, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.63,
      "end_seconds": 166.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.57,
      "text": "How much do you take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.24,
      "end_seconds": 168.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "500 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 171.08,
      "end_seconds": 174.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Do you have everything you need to get home alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.29,
      "end_seconds": 189.51,
      "duration_seconds": 14.22,
      "text": "Yes, um, I've got my transport sorted. It's a bit of a trek, but I'm used to the journey by now, and I brought something to read for the wait."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.07,
      "end_seconds": 192.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.17,
      "end_seconds": 196.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "No, never had any surgery."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.04,
      "end_seconds": 202.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.81,
      "end_seconds": 207.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Eggs. I come out in... well, a rash."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 209.18,
      "end_seconds": 223.11,
      "duration_seconds": 13.93,
      "text": "I like to make sure you understand what's happening, so please stop me at any point. There are no silly questions, and I'd much rather you ask now than go home still wondering about something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.99,
      "end_seconds": 225.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Right, I understand now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.97,
      "end_seconds": 230.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.68,
      "end_seconds": 244.55,
      "duration_seconds": 12.87,
      "text": "I've had thin bones for five years now. I'm not great at remembering details, so bear with me. Yeah, uh, I have an irregular heartbeat, for about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.99,
      "end_seconds": 254.15,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the thin bones in your file as well. So, have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.47,
      "end_seconds": 269.52,
      "duration_seconds": 14.05,
      "text": "Well, for the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.35,
      "end_seconds": 275.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Alright, I'd like to examine you now. Please come over here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.97,
      "end_seconds": 276.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.68,
      "end_seconds": 280.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Turn your head to the side for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.64,
      "end_seconds": 303.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Fingers have good colour and the pulses are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.18,
      "end_seconds": 314.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "That's fine, you can get dressed. Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 315.22,
      "end_seconds": 325.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.56,
      "text": "Hmm, yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 326.24,
      "end_seconds": 349.03,
      "duration_seconds": 22.79,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with a wrist sprain, but a small fracture is possible at this stage. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had pain in your left wrist after a fall for ten days, mild, and no numbness or loss of consciousness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.91,
      "end_seconds": 351.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "That's it, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.51,
      "end_seconds": 357.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.01,
      "end_seconds": 373.28,
      "duration_seconds": 15.27,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 373.98,
      "end_seconds": 380.06,
      "duration_seconds": 6.08,
      "text": "Doctor, I did an X-ray of the wrist before they came in, the result's on your screen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.24,
      "end_seconds": 397.29,
      "duration_seconds": 16.05,
      "text": "Good, thank you. I'd like you to wear a splint until the X-ray result is confirmed and keep the hand raised. I'll also refer you to the orthopaedic clinic. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 398.09,
      "end_seconds": 399.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.89,
      "end_seconds": 406.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.59,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 407.71,
      "end_seconds": 409.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 412.47,
      "end_seconds": 414.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.04,
      "text": "Let's review you in a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 415.15,
      "end_seconds": 419.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Um, sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 420.4,
      "end_seconds": 424.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Okay, summarise it for me, what's the plan from your side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.84,
      "end_seconds": 430.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "So, I come back in a week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 431.78,
      "end_seconds": 435.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 436.84,
      "end_seconds": 438.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "Thanks so much, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 439.05,
      "end_seconds": 439.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}